---
import Lightbox from "@components/Lightbox.astro";
import Merch from "@components/Merch.astro";
import Page from "@components/Page.astro";
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="merch-collection">
  <Page title="Merch Collection">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p>Collection of merch from my days going to shows.</p>
      <Merch img="v1650332839/m19y.dev/IMG_1817_lp9zrh_qnix3y.webp" />
      <Merch img="v1650332840/m19y.dev/IMG_1818_ux6jxg_bnvvmk.webp" />
      <div class="flex">
        <Merch img="v1650332839/m19y.dev/IMG_1824_vhede3_l4gm9l.webp" />
        <Merch img="v1650332840/m19y.dev/IMG_1825_usrqyv_p8ggsq.webp" />
      </div>
      <Merch img="v1650332840/m19y.dev/IMG_1826_higudb_j0ogti.webp" />
      <p>Picked up both of these shirts at the Ottobar 9/10/2010.</p>
      <p>Full show roster: Bane, TUI, Cruel Hand, Alpha & Omega.</p>
      <Merch img="v1650332840/m19y.dev/IMG_2071_ctztu0_yezu5l.webp" />
      <p>
        From a show in 2010 (?) with Terror, Gravemaker, Foundation, Naysayer
        and Violent Side.
      </p>
      <Merch img="v1650332840/m19y.dev/IMG_2366_ik6tzf_uzlhxi.webp" />
      <p>
        Look like this was from Sunday, July 3rd 2011. Lineup: Dead End Path,
        Free Spirit, United Youth, Mob Mentality, Black Rations
      </p>
      <div class="flex">
        <Merch img="v1741830294/m19y.dev/IMG_5480_jpesqw.jpg" />
        <Merch img="v1741830293/m19y.dev/IMG_5481_pfcq9d.jpg" />
      </div>
      <p>
        According to ChatGPT April 23, 2011 (thanks to the one guy who blogged
        about it). Lineup (that I remember): Stick Together, Stout, Sheer Terror
      </p>
    </div>
  </Page>
</Layout>

<Lightbox />
